WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
[no sound] Two young Nekoro recruits, one orange, one grey, circle each other on the sand of the Proving Ring.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.400
The orange recruit pounces. The grey recruit springs aside and dust bursts up where she lands.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.400
They circle again, tails high, while the crowd watches from the stands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.800
The grey recruit leaps in return. The orange one dodges.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.000
Both recruits stop and face each other. The bout is over, honour on both sides.
